Package: swelex
Title: Access the Swedish Code of Statutes via Riksdagen's Open Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Kristian", "Vepsäläinen", , "kristian.vepsalainen@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to search and retrieve the consolidated
    text of Swedish statutes (Svensk författningssamling, SFS) via the
    Riksdag's open data API. Part of the lexverse ecosystem of packages
    for accessing legal and regulatory data.
